How to run TScratch:
--------------------
- Open Matlab
- Move to this folder
- execute "scratchassay"

Requirements:
-------------
- CurveLab library from www.curvelet.org

Further notes:
--------------
- Seems to work with no further setups!
-> Tested with Matlab_R2009a on a machine where CurveLab-2.1.2 was already installed.

- The folder also includes documentation and project files for Matlab Compiler